 "▼ Dive in: <0>Matching demo</0>": "",
 "There is no special skill router: the descriptions are <0>text in the context</0>, and the model predicts the next tokens, which may be a tool call that reads a skill file.": "",
 "It is the same loop as tool calling: model emits a call, the harness runs it, the result is appended.": "",
 "Matching quality depends on the description wording; vague descriptions lead to missed or wrong skills.": "",
 "The word-overlap scorer in the demo is a toy; a real model weighs meaning through attention, not keyword counts.": "",
